/*
 * Implements semantic validation for range list comprehensions.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - validating iterator variables for range iteration,
 *   - supporting both list-mode and tuple-mode comprehensions,
 *   - computing compile-time iteration counts using RangeInterpret,
 *   - constructing LoopValue structures for dynamic list comprehensions,
 *   - constructing TupleValue results for tuple-mode comprehensions,
 *   - propagating copy-mode and mutability rules.
 *
 * Range list comprehensions iterate over integer sequences defined by(fst,
 * scd, step, contains) and support both dynamic and compile-time evaluation
 * paths.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::compose::slicefor::range
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/compose/slicefor/range.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-05-16
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
